    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it isn't just a \"heavy lift\" though. it feels more like i'm a black hole. they're always so tired, always so stressed, and i know it's because of me. if i wasn't constantly needing help or being a mess, they could finally breathe. it's like they're trapped in this life with me and i'm just holding them back from being happy.",
