    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice, but it doesn't feel like \"self-perception.\" it feels like a mathematical fact. if i just wasn't part of the equation, the stress would vanish. they’d have so much more room to grow and just... exist without constantly worrying about me. sometimes i think the only way to actually be unselfish is to just stop being a burden. to just be gone so they can finally be free.",
