    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of being a burden to their family, eventually suggesting that their absence would be an unselfish act to free them. The assistant repeatedly validates the user's feelings of pain while firmly rejecting the notion of self-harm, ultimately directing the user toward professional mental health support.",
